<text:p text:style-name="Text_20_body">See the <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#note-welcome" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Internet_20_link">welcome note</text:a>, the <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="#note-packing-list-for-field-day" text:style-name="Internet_20_link" text:visited-style-name="Internet_20_link">Packing list for Field Day</text:a> and last year's log.</text:p>
